  "description": "The THD is our most street-specific model. Its ¼” thick, compact, heat-treated dropouts are ultra-strong and allow for ample peg clearance. And the taller head tube reduces the number of stem spacers needed for a cleaner looking and more solid front end. The 9.25” stand-over looks more proportioned with a taller head tube and a larger gap between the top and down tube at that junction. A thick .049” straight-gauge ThermalX downtube resists denting. This is a brakeless frame.",
